From 79cd6f7816d844914e26fed862203f384bd3c304 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dardiao <xn--6s1a@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 11:52:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/14] local: drop the remaining join-lemmy.org links

- sort dropdowns: the "?" next to each sort control linked to the official sorting
  documentation; removed
- home: stop rendering the donation dialog, whose only button pointed at
  join-lemmy.org/donate. It was dormant anyway - it only showed for logged-in users whose
  last_donation_notification_at was over a year old, which is nobody on a fresh instance

No rendered page contains a join-lemmy.org link after this.
---
 .../components/common/sort-dropdown.tsx       | 21 ++-----------------
 src/shared/components/home/home.tsx           | 15 -------------
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

